      "name": "What does \"prompt to pipeline\" mean in practical terms?",
      "acceptedAnswer": {
        "@type": "Answer",
        "text": "It means moving from an AI-generated campaign idea (the prompt) to a live, personalized buyer experience, and having that campaign's influence on pipeline and revenue automatically tracked and reported. It combines speed of execution with accountability for results, ensuring marketing efforts are directly tied to revenue impact."
      }
    },
    {
      "@type": "Question",
